  "accepted_differences": [
    "Old Tk and old PySide6 place nested tables in timestamped Markdown sidecar files referenced from the parent table; current rewrite renders the nested table text inline in the parent table cell. The nested table text remains reachable and is treated as an implementation difference for this focused smoke.",
    "Old Tk uses yaml_keys.title/yaml_keys.subtitle labels in this direct import smoke; old PySide6 and current use localized title/subtitle labels. Body and resource semantics are the comparison surface.",
    "Old-system image and nested-table sidecar filenames contain timestamps; the fixture records normalized filename patterns rather than checking in timestamped generated artifacts."
  ],
